If you refactor/move any class (or test) in this package to another, be sure to
edit the following files accordingly, or the tests won't run or you'll get ci
failures from `SKIPPED` `hail_test_java_#` tests!

```
hail/hail/package.mill    (`test-services` selector, `ciTestGrouping` exclusions)
hail/scripts/test-gcp.sh  (`--exclude-package` options)
```
